  "subjectClass": "opaque-min-1px",
  "acceptanceClass": {
    "is": "general-position",
    "because": "The framing rule's own direction -- azimuth 35 degrees, elevation 20 degrees -- over a modelled body. Nothing here is analytic and nothing claims to be: what is compared is which pixels the two sides cover and what colour each body wears, over the whole boundary rather than any one edge."
  },
